<title>USA: GTI Corp says Horn resigns from board.</title>
<headline>GTI Corp says Horn resigns from board.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTI Corp, a maker of networking and network access products, said Andre Horn has retired from the company's board of directors at the age of 69. Horn joined the board in 1977.</p>
</text>
